{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "A Worldforged pickup won by a group roll or given by the master looter stays spent (#7541)",
  "contract": [
    "Issue #7541: a Worldforged pickup could be looted endlessly in a group because only a click or auto-store from the loot window spent it for the character, never a group roll award or a master loot give.",
    "Redfang's Cache spawn 6942481 (835953) is the realm's group-rules pickup (Data15 1) and holds Melika's Ring 500813 (uncommon, the default group threshold) at 100%.",
    "Redridge gnolls guard the cache and their blows interrupt Opening, so each opener carries a fixture Divine Shield 642 while it casts; it changes nothing about who may loot. With group loot the opener needs and the other member passes, so the opener wins the ring. With master loot the master looter opens the cache and gives the ring to the other member. Each character who received the ring must find the cache spent when they open it again: no ring in the loot and still exactly one ring carried."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 180000,
  "location": { "map": 0, "x": -9791.9, "y": -2219.1, "z": 58.627, "o": 3.14 },
  "players": [
